{"seq":3,"slug":"coroutine-implementation","title":"协程的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/coroutines/coroutine-implementation","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"协程的实现机制\">协程的实现机制</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协程的实现由两个正交的维度决定：<strong>栈模型</strong>（无栈 / 有栈）决定协程&quot;如何挂起&quot;，<strong>调度模型</strong>（事件循环 / GMP）决定协程&quot;由谁调度、何时运行&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无栈协程</th>\n<th>有栈协程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现原理</td>\n<td>编译器转换为状态机</td>\n<td>为每个协程分配独立栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>挂起限制</td>\n<td>只能在顶层 yield/await 点</td>\n<td>可在任意嵌套调用处挂起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>极小（数十~数百字节）</td>\n<td>较大（2KB~1MB 栈空间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>async/await、Generator</td>\n<td>Goroutine、Lua coroutine</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  I[&quot;协程实现机制&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;按栈模型&quot;]&#10;  I --&gt; D[&quot;按调度模型&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; S1[&quot;无栈:编译器转状态机&lt;br/&gt;内存极小,只能顶层挂起&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; S2[&quot;有栈:独立栈 + 栈指针切换&lt;br/&gt;可任意嵌套挂起&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[&quot;事件循环&lt;br/&gt;单线程,天然无竞争&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[&quot;GMP 模型&lt;br/&gt;M:N 映射 + 工作窃取&quot;]\">graph TD\n  I[\"协程实现机制\"] --&gt; S[\"按栈模型\"]\n  I --&gt; D[\"按调度模型\"]\n  S --&gt; S1[\"无栈:编译器转状态机&lt;br/&gt;内存极小,只能顶层挂起\"]\n  S --&gt; S2[\"有栈:独立栈 + 栈指针切换&lt;br/&gt;可任意嵌套挂起\"]\n  D --&gt; D1[\"事件循环&lt;br/&gt;单线程,天然无竞争\"]\n  D --&gt; D2[\"GMP 模型&lt;br/&gt;M:N 映射 + 工作窃取\"]</pre><p>两个维度可以自由组合，选择依据是任务特征：轻量 I/O 选无栈协程，深层嵌套选有栈协程；单线程异步选事件循环，多核并行选 GMP 类调度器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>协程的实现方式主要分为两大类：<strong>无栈协程（Stackless Coroutine）</strong> 和 <strong>有栈协程（Stackful Coroutine）</strong>。两者在内存模型、灵活性和性能上各有取舍。此外，协程的运行离不开调度机制，常见的有<strong>事件循环（Event Loop）<strong>和</strong>多线程协程调度器</strong>（如 GMP 模型）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    A[&quot;Coroutine Implementation Mechanisms&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;By Stack Model&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;By Scheduling Model&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;Stackless Coroutine&lt;br/&gt;State Machine Implementation&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;Stackful Coroutine&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack Implementation&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;Event Loop&lt;br/&gt;Single-threaded Scheduling&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;Multi-threaded Scheduler&lt;br/&gt;M:N Mapping&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    A[\"Coroutine Implementation Mechanisms\"] --&gt; B[\"By Stack Model\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"By Scheduling Model\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"Stackless Coroutine&lt;br/&gt;State Machine Implementation\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"Stackful Coroutine&lt;br/&gt;Independent Stack Implementation\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"Event Loop&lt;br/&gt;Single-threaded Scheduling\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"Multi-threaded Scheduler&lt;br/&gt;M:N Mapping\"]</pre><h2 id=\"无栈协程-状态机实现\">无栈协程：状态机实现</h2><p>无栈协程没有独立的调用栈，编译器将协程函数转换为一个<strong>状态机（State Machine）</strong>。每次 <code>yield</code> 或 <code>await</code> 对应状态机的一个状态转换，协程的局部变量被提升为状态机对象的字段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"转换原理\">转换原理</h3><p>一个包含多个 <code>await</code> 点的异步函数，会被编译器拆分为多个状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 原始协程代码&#10;协程 fetchAndProcess():&#10;    data = await 读取网络数据()     // 挂起点 1&#10;    parsed = 解析数据(data)&#10;    result = await 写入数据库(parsed) // 挂起点 2&#10;    return result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 原始协程代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>协程 fetchAndProcess():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = await 读取网络数据()     // 挂起点 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    parsed = 解析数据(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = await 写入数据库(parsed) // 挂起点 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return result</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器将其转换为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 编译器生成的状态机&#10;类 FetchAndProcess_StateMachine:&#10;    state = 0&#10;    data = null&#10;    parsed = null&#10;    result = null&#10;&#10;    函数 resume():&#10;        switch this.state:&#10;            case 0:&#10;                启动异步读取网络数据()&#10;                this.state = 1&#10;                return PENDING&#10;            case 1:&#10;                this.data = 获取异步结果()&#10;                this.parsed = 解析数据(this.data)&#10;                启动异步写入数据库(this.parsed)&#10;                this.state = 2&#10;                return PENDING&#10;            case 2:&#10;                this.result = 获取异步结果()&#10;                return COMPLETE(this.result)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译器生成的状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>类 FetchAndProcess_StateMachine:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    state = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    parsed = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    函数 resume():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        switch this.state:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                启动异步读取网络数据()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                this.state = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return PENDING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 1:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                this.data = 获取异步结果()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                this.parsed = 解析数据(this.data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                启动异步写入数据库(this.parsed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                this.state = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return PENDING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            case 2:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                this.result = 获取异步结果()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return COMPLETE(this.result)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; State0: Create Coroutine&#10;    State0 --&gt; State1: await Read Network Data&#10;    State1 --&gt; State2: await Write to Database&#10;    State2 --&gt; [*]: return result&#10;&#10;    state State0 {&#10;        [*] --&gt; InitiateNetworkRequest&#10;    }&#10;    state State1 {&#10;        [*] --&gt; ParseData&#10;        ParseData --&gt; InitiateDatabaseWrite&#10;    }&#10;    state State2 {&#10;        [*] --&gt; GetWriteResult&#10;    }\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; State0: Create Coroutine\n    State0 --&gt; State1: await Read Network Data\n    State1 --&gt; State2: await Write to Database\n    State2 --&gt; [*]: return result\n\n    state State0 {\n        [*] --&gt; InitiateNetworkRequest\n    }\n    state State1 {\n        [*] --&gt; ParseData\n        ParseData --&gt; InitiateDatabaseWrite\n    }\n    state State2 {\n        [*] --&gt; GetWriteResult\n    }</pre><h3 id=\"无栈协程的内存布局\">无栈协程的内存布局</h3><p>无栈协程的所有状态存储在一个堆上分配的对象中，不需要独立的栈空间：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 无栈协程状态机对象[&quot;无栈协程状态机对象 (数十到数百字节)&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        F1[&quot;state: number (当前状态)&quot;]&#10;        F2[&quot;local_a: any (局部变量 a)&quot;]&#10;        F3[&quot;local_b: any (局部变量 b)&quot;]&#10;        F4[&quot;temp: any (临时变量)&quot;]&#10;        F5[&quot;result_slot: any (返回值)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 无栈协程状态机对象[\"无栈协程状态机对象 (数十到数百字节)\"]\n        direction TB\n        F1[\"state: number (当前状态)\"]\n        F2[\"local_a: any (局部变量 a)\"]\n        F3[\"local_b: any (局部变量 b)\"]\n        F4[\"temp: any (临时变量)\"]\n        F5[\"result_slot: any (返回值)\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"typescript-中的无栈协程\">TypeScript 中的无栈协程</h3><p>TypeScript/JavaScript 的 <code>async/await</code> 和 <code>Generator</code> 都是无栈协程的典型实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function processItems(items: string[]): Promise&lt;string[]&gt; {&#10;  const results: string[] = [];&#10;  for (const item of items) {&#10;    const processed = await transformItem(item);&#10;    results.push(processed);&#10;  }&#10;  return results;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function transformItem(item: string): Promise&lt;string&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(`/api/transform?input=${item}`);&#10;  const data = await response.json();&#10;  return data.result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processItems</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> processed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(item);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(processed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transformItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/transform?input=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">item</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>引擎在底层将上述代码转换为状态机。每个 <code>await</code> 点将函数执行切分为若干段，只有当异步操作完成时，状态机才推进到下一个状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有栈协程-独立栈实现\">有栈协程：独立栈实现</h2><p>有栈协程为每个协程分配一块<strong>独立的栈空间</strong>，使其拥有完整的调用栈。这意味着有栈协程可以在<strong>任意嵌套调用深度</strong>处挂起和恢复，灵活性远超无栈协程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"栈切换原理\">栈切换原理</h3><p>有栈协程的切换本质是<strong>栈指针的切换</strong>：保存当前协程的栈指针和寄存器，然后恢复目标协程的栈指针和寄存器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 switch_coroutine(from, to):&#10;    // 1. 保存当前协程的 CPU 状态&#10;    from.saved_sp = 当前栈指针&#10;    from.saved_pc = 当前程序计数器&#10;    from.saved_registers = 当前寄存器组&#10;&#10;    // 2. 恢复目标协程的 CPU 状态&#10;    设置栈指针(to.saved_sp)&#10;    设置寄存器组(to.saved_registers)&#10;    跳转到(to.saved_pc)&#10;    // 从目标协程上次挂起的位置继续执行\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 switch_coroutine(from, to):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 1. 保存当前协程的 CPU 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    from.saved_sp = 当前栈指针</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    from.saved_pc = 当前程序计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    from.saved_registers = 当前寄存器组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 2. 恢复目标协程的 CPU 状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    设置栈指针(to.saved_sp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    设置寄存器组(to.saved_registers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    跳转到(to.saved_pc)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 从目标协程上次挂起的位置继续执行</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Coroutine A Stack Space&#10;        direction TB&#10;        A1[&quot;main()&quot;] --&gt; A2[&quot;funcA()&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; A3[&quot;funcB()&quot;]&#10;        A3 --&gt; A4[&quot;← SP_A Stack Top&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Coroutine B Stack Space&#10;        direction TB&#10;        B1[&quot;main()&quot;] --&gt; B2[&quot;funcX()&quot;]&#10;        B2 --&gt; B3[&quot;← SP_B Stack Top&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Switching Process&#10;        direction TB&#10;        SW1[&quot;Save SP_A&quot;] --&gt; SW2[&quot;Restore SP_B&quot;]&#10;        SW2 --&gt; SW3[&quot;Jump to Coroutine B&lt;br/&gt;Last Suspended Position&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Coroutine A Stack Space\n        direction TB\n        A1[\"main()\"] --&gt; A2[\"funcA()\"]\n        A2 --&gt; A3[\"funcB()\"]\n        A3 --&gt; A4[\"← SP_A Stack Top\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Coroutine B Stack Space\n        direction TB\n        B1[\"main()\"] --&gt; B2[\"funcX()\"]\n        B2 --&gt; B3[\"← SP_B Stack Top\"]\n    end\n    subgraph Switching Process\n        direction TB\n        SW1[\"Save SP_A\"] --&gt; SW2[\"Restore SP_B\"]\n        SW2 --&gt; SW3[\"Jump to Coroutine B&lt;br/&gt;Last Suspended Position\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"有栈协程的内存布局\">有栈协程的内存布局</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 协程A栈[&quot;协程 A 的独立栈 (通常 2KB ~ 1MB)&quot;]&#10;        direction TB&#10;        S1[&quot;函数 main() 的栈帧&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;函数 funcA() 的栈帧&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;函数 funcB() 的栈帧&quot;]&#10;        S4[&quot;← 栈顶指针 SP&quot;]&#10;        S5[&quot;(未使用的栈空间)&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 协程A栈[\"协程 A 的独立栈 (通常 2KB ~ 1MB)\"]\n        direction TB\n        S1[\"函数 main() 的栈帧\"]\n        S2[\"函数 funcA() 的栈帧\"]\n        S3[\"函数 funcB() 的栈帧\"]\n        S4[\"← 栈顶指针 SP\"]\n        S5[\"(未使用的栈空间)\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"无栈-vs-有栈协程对比\">无栈 vs 有栈协程对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>无栈协程</th>\n<th>有栈协程</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>实现原理</td>\n<td>编译器转换为状态机</td>\n<td>为每个协程分配独立栈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>挂起限制</td>\n<td>只能在顶层函数的 yield/await 点挂起</td>\n<td>可在任意嵌套调用处挂起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存占用</td>\n<td>极小（数十~数百字节）</td>\n<td>较大（2KB~1MB 栈空间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>创建速度</td>\n<td>极快（分配一个小对象）</td>\n<td>较快（需分配栈空间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换速度</td>\n<td>极快（状态机推进）</td>\n<td>快（栈指针切换）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌套灵活性</td>\n<td>低（async 具有传染性）</td>\n<td>高（透明挂起）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈溢出风险</td>\n<td>无（使用堆内存）</td>\n<td>有（栈空间固定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>async/await、Generator</td>\n<td>Goroutine、Lua coroutine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>异步 I/O、事件驱动编程</td>\n<td>需要深层嵌套挂起的通用并发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"调度机制一-事件循环\">调度机制一：事件循环</h2><p>事件循环（Event Loop）是单线程环境下调度协程的核心机制。它维护一个任务队列，不断从中取出就绪的协程并执行，直到协程遇到下一个挂起点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"事件循环的工作流程\">事件循环的工作流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Event Loop Starts&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Dequeue a Task from Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;Is the Queue Empty?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| D[&quot;Check I/O Events&lt;br/&gt;(epoll / kqueue)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;Any Ready I/O Events?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;Yes&quot;| F[&quot;Add Corresponding Coroutine to Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| G[&quot;Wait Until an Event Occurs&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; D&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;No&quot;| H[&quot;Execute the Coroutine/Task&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I{&quot;Is Coroutine Suspended?&quot;}&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;Yes (await I/O)&quot;| J[&quot;Register I/O Callback&lt;br/&gt;Remove Coroutine from Ready Queue&quot;]&#10;    J --&gt; B&#10;    I --&gt;|&quot;No (Execution Complete)&quot;| K[&quot;Clean Up Coroutine Resources&quot;]&#10;    K --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Event Loop Starts\"] --&gt; B[\"Dequeue a Task from Ready Queue\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"Is the Queue Empty?\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"Yes\"| D[\"Check I/O Events&lt;br/&gt;(epoll / kqueue)\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"Any Ready I/O Events?\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"Yes\"| F[\"Add Corresponding Coroutine to Ready Queue\"]\n    F --&gt; B\n    E --&gt;|\"No\"| G[\"Wait Until an Event Occurs\"]\n    G --&gt; D\n    C --&gt;|\"No\"| H[\"Execute the Coroutine/Task\"]\n    H --&gt; I{\"Is Coroutine Suspended?\"}\n    I --&gt;|\"Yes (await I/O)\"| J[\"Register I/O Callback&lt;br/&gt;Remove Coroutine from Ready Queue\"]\n    J --&gt; B\n    I --&gt;|\"No (Execution Complete)\"| K[\"Clean Up Coroutine Resources\"]\n    K --&gt; B</pre><h3 id=\"事件循环伪代码\">事件循环伪代码</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"类 EventLoop:&#10;    ready_queue = []        // 就绪队列&#10;    io_watcher = 创建IO监视器()  // epoll / kqueue&#10;&#10;    函数 run():&#10;        while true:&#10;            // 1. 执行所有就绪的协程&#10;            while ready_queue 非空:&#10;                task = ready_queue.取出()&#10;                result = task.resume()&#10;                if result == PENDING:&#10;                    // 协程挂起，等待 I/O&#10;                    io_watcher.注册(task.等待的fd, task)&#10;                else:&#10;                    // 协程完成&#10;                    task.完成回调(result)&#10;&#10;            // 2. 等待 I/O 事件&#10;            events = io_watcher.等待事件()&#10;            for event in events:&#10;                ready_queue.加入(event.对应的协程)&#10;&#10;    函数 spawn(协程):&#10;        ready_queue.加入(协程)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>类 EventLoop:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ready_queue = []        // 就绪队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    io_watcher = 创建IO监视器()  // epoll / kqueue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    函数 run():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 1. 执行所有就绪的协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            while ready_queue 非空:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                task = ready_queue.取出()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                result = task.resume()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if result == PENDING:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    // 协程挂起，等待 I/O</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    io_watcher.注册(task.等待的fd, task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                else:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    // 协程完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    task.完成回调(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 2. 等待 I/O 事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            events = io_watcher.等待事件()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for event in events:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                ready_queue.加入(event.对应的协程)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    函数 spawn(协程):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ready_queue.加入(协程)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>事件循环在 Node.js、浏览器 JavaScript 运行时中是核心调度机制——所有 <code>async/await</code> 的调度都依赖事件循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"调度机制二-gmp-模型\">调度机制二：GMP 模型</h2><p>对于需要利用多核 CPU 的场景，单线程事件循环就不够了。GMP 模型是一种经典的<strong>多线程协程调度模型</strong>，将大量协程（M 个）映射到少量操作系统线程（N 个）上，实现 <strong>M:N 调度</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gmp-的三个核心组件\">GMP 的三个核心组件</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>全称</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>G</strong></td>\n<td>Goroutine</td>\n<td>协程，用户级的轻量执行单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>M</strong></td>\n<td>Machine</td>\n<td>操作系统线程，实际执行代码的载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>P</strong></td>\n<td>Processor</td>\n<td>逻辑处理器，绑定 M 与 G 的桥梁，管理本地运行队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"gmp-调度流程\">GMP 调度流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Global Queue&#10;        GQ[Global G Queue&lt;br/&gt;[G5, G6, G7, ...]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph P1[&quot;P1 Logical Processor&quot;]&#10;        LQ1[Local Queue: [G1, G2]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph P2[&quot;P2 Logical Processor&quot;]&#10;        LQ2[Local Queue: [G3, G4]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph OS Threads&#10;        M1[&quot;M1 Thread&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;M2 Thread&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    P1 --&gt;|&quot;Bind to&quot;| M1&#10;    P2 --&gt;|&quot;Bind to&quot;| M2&#10;    M1 --&gt;|&quot;Execute&quot;| G1R[&quot;Currently Running: G1&quot;]&#10;    M2 --&gt;|&quot;Execute&quot;| G3R[&quot;Currently Running: G3&quot;]&#10;    GQ -.-&gt;|&quot;When Local Queue Empty&lt;br/&gt;Fetch from Global Queue&quot;| P1&#10;    GQ -.-&gt;|&quot;When Local Queue Empty&lt;br/&gt;Fetch from Global Queue&quot;| P2&#10;    P1 -.-&gt;|&quot;Work Stealing&quot;| P2\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Global Queue\n        GQ[Global G Queue&lt;br/&gt;[G5, G6, G7, ...]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph P1[\"P1 Logical Processor\"]\n        LQ1[Local Queue: [G1, G2]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph P2[\"P2 Logical Processor\"]\n        LQ2[Local Queue: [G3, G4]\"]\n    end\n    subgraph OS Threads\n        M1[\"M1 Thread\"]\n        M2[\"M2 Thread\"]\n    end\n\n    P1 --&gt;|\"Bind to\"| M1\n    P2 --&gt;|\"Bind to\"| M2\n    M1 --&gt;|\"Execute\"| G1R[\"Currently Running: G1\"]\n    M2 --&gt;|\"Execute\"| G3R[\"Currently Running: G3\"]\n    GQ -.-&gt;|\"When Local Queue Empty&lt;br/&gt;Fetch from Global Queue\"| P1\n    GQ -.-&gt;|\"When Local Queue Empty&lt;br/&gt;Fetch from Global Queue\"| P2\n    P1 -.-&gt;|\"Work Stealing\"| P2</pre><h3 id=\"gmp-调度策略\">GMP 调度策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"函数 schedule(P):&#10;    while true:&#10;        // 1. 优先从本地队列取 G&#10;        g = P.本地队列.取出()&#10;&#10;        // 2. 本地队列为空，从全局队列取一批&#10;        if g == null:&#10;            g = 全局队列.取出一批(P)&#10;&#10;        // 3. 全局队列也为空，从其他 P 偷取一半&#10;        if g == null:&#10;            g = 从其他P偷取(P)&#10;&#10;        // 4. 执行协程&#10;        if g != null:&#10;            执行(g)&#10;            if g.状态 == 挂起:&#10;                P.本地队列.加入(g)  // 放回本地队列等待恢复\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>函数 schedule(P):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while true:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 1. 优先从本地队列取 G</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        g = P.本地队列.取出()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 2. 本地队列为空，从全局队列取一批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if g == null:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            g = 全局队列.取出一批(P)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 3. 全局队列也为空，从其他 P 偷取一半</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if g == null:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            g = 从其他P偷取(P)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 4. 执行协程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if g != null:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            执行(g)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if g.状态 == 挂起:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                P.本地队列.加入(g)  // 放回本地队列等待恢复</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工作窃取-work-stealing\">工作窃取（Work Stealing）</h3><p>GMP 模型中的核心优化策略是<strong>工作窃取</strong>：当某个 P 的本地队列为空时，它会尝试从其他 P 的本地队列中偷取一半的 G，实现负载均衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant P1 as P1 (Queue Empty)&#10;    participant P2 as P2 (Queue Full)&#10;    participant GQ as Global Queue&#10;&#10;    P1-&gt;&gt;P1: Local queue is empty&#10;    P1-&gt;&gt;GQ: Try to fetch from global queue&#10;    GQ--&gt;&gt;P1: Global queue is also empty&#10;    P1-&gt;&gt;P2: Try to steal half of the tasks&#10;    P2--&gt;&gt;P1: Transfer [G5, G6, G7]&#10;    P1-&gt;&gt;P1: Start executing G5\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant P1 as P1 (Queue Empty)\n    participant P2 as P2 (Queue Full)\n    participant GQ as Global Queue\n\n    P1-&gt;&gt;P1: Local queue is empty\n    P1-&gt;&gt;GQ: Try to fetch from global queue\n    GQ--&gt;&gt;P1: Global queue is also empty\n    P1-&gt;&gt;P2: Try to steal half of the tasks\n    P2--&gt;&gt;P1: Transfer [G5, G6, G7]\n    P1-&gt;&gt;P1: Start executing G5</pre><h2 id=\"事件循环-vs-gmp-模型对比\">事件循环 vs GMP 模型对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>事件循环</th>\n<th>GMP 模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线程数</td>\n<td>单线程</td>\n<td>多线程（M 个 OS 线程）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行能力</td>\n<td>无真正并行</td>\n<td>支持多核并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>I/O 密集型</td>\n<td>I/O + CPU 密集型混合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>复杂（需要工作窃取等策略）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据竞争</td>\n<td>天然无竞争（单线程）</td>\n<td>需要处理跨线程竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型代表</td>\n<td>Node.js、浏览器 JS</td>\n<td>Goroutine 运行时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>受限于单核</td>\n<td>可扩展到多核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Event Loop Model&#10;        direction TB&#10;        EL[&quot;Event Loop&lt;br/&gt;(Single Thread)&quot;] --&gt; EG1[&quot;Coroutine 1&quot;]&#10;        EL --&gt; EG2[&quot;Coroutine 2&quot;]&#10;        EL --&gt; EG3[&quot;Coroutine 3&quot;]&#10;        EL --&gt; EG4[&quot;Coroutine ...&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GMP Model&#10;        direction TB&#10;        GM1[&quot;Thread M1&quot;] --&gt; GP1[&quot;P1&quot;]&#10;        GM2[&quot;Thread M2&quot;] --&gt; GP2[&quot;P2&quot;]&#10;        GP1 --&gt; GG1[&quot;G1, G2, G3&quot;]&#10;        GP2 --&gt; GG2[&quot;G4, G5, G6&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Event Loop Model\n        direction TB\n        EL[\"Event Loop&lt;br/&gt;(Single Thread)\"] --&gt; EG1[\"Coroutine 1\"]\n        EL --&gt; EG2[\"Coroutine 2\"]\n        EL --&gt; EG3[\"Coroutine 3\"]\n        EL --&gt; EG4[\"Coroutine ...\"]\n    end\n    subgraph GMP Model\n        direction TB\n        GM1[\"Thread M1\"] --&gt; GP1[\"P1\"]\n        GM2[\"Thread M2\"] --&gt; GP2[\"P2\"]\n        GP1 --&gt; GG1[\"G1, G2, G3\"]\n        GP2 --&gt; GG2[\"G4, G5, G6\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>无栈协程通过<strong>编译器将协程转换为状态机</strong>实现，每个 await 点对应一个状态，局部变量提升为状态对象的字段，内存占用极小。</li>\n<li>有栈协程为每个协程分配<strong>独立的栈空间</strong>，通过栈指针切换实现挂起/恢复，可在任意嵌套调用处挂起，灵活性更高。</li>\n<li><strong>事件循环</strong>是单线程协程调度的核心机制，通过就绪队列和 I/O 事件监听不断驱动协程执行，适合 I/O 密集型场景。</li>\n<li><strong>GMP 模型</strong>是多线程协程调度的经典方案，通过 G（协程）、M（线程）、P（逻辑处理器）三层结构实现 M:N 映射，配合工作窃取策略实现负载均衡。</li>\n<li>选择哪种实现取决于具体需求：单线程异步选事件循环，多核并行选 GMP 类调度器，轻量 I/O 选无栈协程，深层嵌套选有栈协程。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"协程的实现机制","id":"协程的实现机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"无栈协程：状态机实现","id":"无栈协程-状态机实现"},{"level":3,"text":"转换原理","id":"转换原理"},{"level":3,"text":"无栈协程的内存布局","id":"无栈协程的内存布局"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 中的无栈协程","id":"typescript-中的无栈协程"},{"level":2,"text":"有栈协程：独立栈实现","id":"有栈协程-独立栈实现"},{"level":3,"text":"栈切换原理","id":"栈切换原理"},{"level":3,"text":"有栈协程的内存布局","id":"有栈协程的内存布局"},{"level":2,"text":"无栈 vs 有栈协程对比","id":"无栈-vs-有栈协程对比"},{"level":2,"text":"调度机制一：事件循环","id":"调度机制一-事件循环"},{"level":3,"text":"事件循环的工作流程","id":"事件循环的工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"事件循环伪代码","id":"事件循环伪代码"},{"level":2,"text":"调度机制二：GMP 模型","id":"调度机制二-gmp-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"GMP 的三个核心组件","id":"gmp-的三个核心组件"},{"level":3,"text":"GMP 调度流程","id":"gmp-调度流程"},{"level":3,"text":"GMP 调度策略","id":"gmp-调度策略"},{"level":3,"text":"工作窃取（Work Stealing）","id":"工作窃取-work-stealing"},{"level":2,"text":"事件循环 vs GMP 模型对比","id":"事件循环-vs-gmp-模型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协程的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/coroutines/coroutine-core-ideas"},"next":{"title":"并发与并行的核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/concurrency-and-parallelism/concurrency-parallelism-concepts"}}